<title>MONACO: TENNIS-MONTE CARLO OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS. [CORRECTED 16:40 GMT]</title>
<headline>TENNIS-MONTE CARLO OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS. [CORRECTED 16:40 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>MONTE CARLO 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in the</p>
<p>$2,300,000 Monte Carlo men's Open tennis tournament on Tuesday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Andrei Medvedev (Ukraine) beat Nicklas Kulti (Sweden) 4-6 6-2</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Francisco Clavet (Spain) beat Thomas Johansson (Sweden) 6-1 6-2</p>
<p>15-Marc Rosset (Switzerland) beat Roberto Carretero (Spain) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-2) 6-0</p>
<p>Jan Siemerink (Netherlands) beat Andrei Merinov (Russia) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-2) 6-3</p>
<p>Daniel Vacek (Czech Republic) beat Mikael Tillstroem (Sweden)</p>
<p>6-1 6-3</p>
<p>12-Alex Corretja (Spain) beat Nuno Marques (Portugal) 6-0 6-0</p>
<p>Renzo Furlan (Italy) beat 9-Boris Becker (Germany) 1-6 6-3 7-6</p>
<p>(7-4)</p>
<p>Mark Philippoussis (Australia) beat Hernan Gumy (Argentina) 6-1</p>
<p>7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>14-Alberto Berasategui (Spain) beat Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands)</p>
<p>6-3 7-5</p>
<p>11-Felix Mantilla (Spain) beat Martin Damm (Czech Republic) 6-1</p>
<p>6-1</p>
<p>Fabrice Santoro (France) beat 2-Thomas Muster (Austria) 6-2 7-6</p>
<p>(7-3)</p>
<p>(Corrects Santoro-Muster first set score from 6-1).</p>
<p>10-Albert Costa (Spain) beat Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden) 6-4 6-0</p>
<p>Andrea Gaudenzi (Italy) beat Lionel Roux (France) 6-1 6-2</p>
<p>Michael Stich (Germany) beat Mark Woodforde (Australia) 3-6 7-5</p>
<p>7-5</p>
<p>Add second round:</p>
<p>Magnus Larsson (Sweden) beat 1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) 3-6 6-2 6-3</p>
</text>
